<title>FINLAND: Finnish Oct wholesale prices rise 1.2 pct yr/yr-SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish Oct wholesale prices rise 1.2 pct yr/yr-SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish wholesale price index rose 0.7 percent in October on September and it rose 1.2 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>			     Oct 1996    Sept 1996    Sept 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth		   +0.7 pct	+0.6 pct    +/-0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		     +1.2 pct	+0.5 pct    -0.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
